    "preview": "<main class=\"n0\">\n  <div class=\"n1\">\n    <div class=\"n2\">\n      <div class=\"n3\">\n        <div class=\"n4\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n5\">\n          <div class=\"n6\">\n            <p class=\"n7\">Amara Okafor</p>\n            <div class=\"n8\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"n9\">@amara_builds</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"n10\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"n11\">Rebuilt our whole landing page over lunch. Shipping this fast feels illegal.</p>\n      <p class=\"n12\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n13\">\n      <div class=\"n14\">\n        <div class=\"n15\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n16\">\n          <div class=\"n17\">\n            <p class=\"n18\">Daniel Mensah</p>\n            <div class=\"n19\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"n20\">@danielmensah</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"n21\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"n22\">The little details in this are unreal. Spacing, states, focus rings. Someone cared.</p>\n      <p class=\"n23\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n24\">\n      <div class=\"n25\">\n        <div class=\"n26\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n27\">\n          <div class=\"n28\">\n            <p class=\"n29\">Zainab Bello</p>\n            <div class=\"n30\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"n31\">@zainabbello</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"n32\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"n33\">Handed a site to a client and they edited it themselves on day one. Never going back.</p>\n      <p class=\"n34\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n35\">\n      <div class=\"n36\">\n        <div class=\"n37\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n38\">\n          <div class=\"n39\">\n            <p class=\"n40\">Tunde Adeyemi</p>\n            <div class=\"n41\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"n42\">@tundeadeyemi</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"n43\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"n44\">Went from idea to live in a day. Our team is still in shock.</p>\n      <p class=\"n45\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n46\">\n      <div class=\"n47\">\n        <div class=\"n48\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n49\">\n          <div class=\"n50\">\n            <p class=\"n51\">Ngozi Eze</p>\n            <div class=\"n52\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"n53\">@ngozieze</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"n54\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"n55\">Finally a tool that exports clean code my developers do not complain about.</p>\n      <p class=\"n56\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n57\">\n      <div class=\"n58\">\n        <div class=\"n59\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n60\">\n          <div class=\"n61\">\n            <p class=\"n62\">Emeka Obi</p>\n            <div class=\"n63\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"n64\">@emekaobi</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"n65\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"n66\">Quietly the best thing we added to our stack this year.</p>\n      <p class=\"n67\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>",
