    "preview": "<main class=\"n0\">\n  <div class=\"n1\" data-ui=\"ts-snap\">\n    <div class=\"n2\">\n      <p class=\"n3\">★★★★★</p>\n      <p class=\"n4\">Switching saved our team hours every week. We shipped our new site in a single afternoon.</p>\n      <div class=\"n5\">\n        <div class=\"n6\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n7\">\n          <p class=\"n8\">Amara Okafor</p>\n          <p class=\"n9\">Founder, Northwind</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n10\">\n      <p class=\"n11\">★★★★★</p>\n      <p class=\"n12\">The details are right. Everything feels considered, and support answers within minutes.</p>\n      <div class=\"n13\">\n        <div class=\"n14\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n15\">\n          <p class=\"n16\">Daniel Mensah</p>\n          <p class=\"n17\">Design lead, Kora</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n18\">\n      <p class=\"n19\">★★★★★</p>\n      <p class=\"n20\">We tried five tools before this one. Nothing else was this simple to hand over to clients.</p>\n      <div class=\"n21\">\n        <div class=\"n22\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n23\">\n          <p class=\"n24\">Zainab Bello</p>\n          <p class=\"n25\">Agency owner</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n26\">\n      <p class=\"n27\">★★★★★</p>\n      <p class=\"n28\">Our conversion rate went up 31% after we rebuilt the landing page. It took two days.</p>\n      <div class=\"n29\">\n        <div class=\"n30\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n31\">\n          <p class=\"n32\">Tunde Adeyemi</p>\n          <p class=\"n33\">Growth lead, Lumen</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n34\">\n      <p class=\"n35\">★★★★★</p>\n      <p class=\"n36\">I stopped dreading website updates. My whole team can edit pages without asking me.</p>\n      <div class=\"n37\">\n        <div class=\"n38\"></div>\n        <div class=\"n39\">\n          <p class=\"n40\">Ngozi Eze</p>\n          <p class=\"n41\">Operations, Halo</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>",
