    "preview": "<main class=\"n0\">\n  <div class=\"n1\" data-ui=\"ts-marquee\">\n    <div class=\"n2\" data-p=\"track\">\n      <div class=\"n3\">\n        <p class=\"n4\">Switching saved our team hours every week. We shipped our new site in a single afternoon.</p>\n        <div class=\"n5\">\n          <div class=\"n6\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n7\">\n            <p class=\"n8\">Amara Okafor</p>\n            <p class=\"n9\">Founder, Northwind</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n10\">\n        <p class=\"n11\">The details are right. Everything feels considered, and support answers within minutes.</p>\n        <div class=\"n12\">\n          <div class=\"n13\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n14\">\n            <p class=\"n15\">Daniel Mensah</p>\n            <p class=\"n16\">Design lead, Kora</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n17\">\n        <p class=\"n18\">We tried five tools before this one. Nothing else was this simple to hand over to clients.</p>\n        <div class=\"n19\">\n          <div class=\"n20\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n21\">\n            <p class=\"n22\">Zainab Bello</p>\n            <p class=\"n23\">Agency owner</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n24\">\n        <p class=\"n25\">Our conversion rate went up 31% after we rebuilt the landing page. It took two days.</p>\n        <div class=\"n26\">\n          <div class=\"n27\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n28\">\n            <p class=\"n29\">Tunde Adeyemi</p>\n            <p class=\"n30\">Growth lead, Lumen</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n31\">\n        <p class=\"n32\">I stopped dreading website updates. My whole team can edit pages without asking me.</p>\n        <div class=\"n33\">\n          <div class=\"n34\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n35\">\n            <p class=\"n36\">Ngozi Eze</p>\n            <p class=\"n37\">Operations, Halo</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n38\">\n        <p class=\"n39\">Clean output, fast pages and honest pricing. Exactly what a small studio needs.</p>\n        <div class=\"n40\">\n          <div class=\"n41\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n42\">\n            <p class=\"n43\">Emeka Obi</p>\n            <p class=\"n44\">Studio director</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n45\">\n        <p class=\"n46\">Switching saved our team hours every week. We shipped our new site in a single afternoon.</p>\n        <div class=\"n47\">\n          <div class=\"n48\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n49\">\n            <p class=\"n50\">Amara Okafor</p>\n            <p class=\"n51\">Founder, Northwind</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n52\">\n        <p class=\"n53\">The details are right. Everything feels considered, and support answers within minutes.</p>\n        <div class=\"n54\">\n          <div class=\"n55\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n56\">\n            <p class=\"n57\">Daniel Mensah</p>\n            <p class=\"n58\">Design lead, Kora</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n59\">\n        <p class=\"n60\">We tried five tools before this one. Nothing else was this simple to hand over to clients.</p>\n        <div class=\"n61\">\n          <div class=\"n62\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n63\">\n            <p class=\"n64\">Zainab Bello</p>\n            <p class=\"n65\">Agency owner</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n66\">\n        <p class=\"n67\">Our conversion rate went up 31% after we rebuilt the landing page. It took two days.</p>\n        <div class=\"n68\">\n          <div class=\"n69\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n70\">\n            <p class=\"n71\">Tunde Adeyemi</p>\n            <p class=\"n72\">Growth lead, Lumen</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n73\">\n        <p class=\"n74\">I stopped dreading website updates. My whole team can edit pages without asking me.</p>\n        <div class=\"n75\">\n          <div class=\"n76\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n77\">\n            <p class=\"n78\">Ngozi Eze</p>\n            <p class=\"n79\">Operations, Halo</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n80\">\n        <p class=\"n81\">Clean output, fast pages and honest pricing. Exactly what a small studio needs.</p>\n        <div class=\"n82\">\n          <div class=\"n83\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n84\">\n            <p class=\"n85\">Emeka Obi</p>\n            <p class=\"n86\">Studio director</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>",
