    "preview": "<main class=\"n0\">\n  <section class=\"n1\">\n    <div class=\"n2\">\n      <h2 class=\"n3\">Kind words</h2>\n      <p class=\"n4\">Straight from the people who use it every day.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n5\">\n      <div class=\"n6\">\n        <p class=\"n7\">★★★★★</p>\n        <p class=\"n8\">Our conversion rate went up 31% after we rebuilt the landing page. It took two days.</p>\n        <div class=\"n9\">\n          <div class=\"n10\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n11\">\n            <p class=\"n12\">Tunde Adeyemi</p>\n            <p class=\"n13\">Growth lead, Lumen</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n14\">\n        <p class=\"n15\">★★★★★</p>\n        <p class=\"n16\">I stopped dreading website updates. My whole team can edit pages without asking me.</p>\n        <div class=\"n17\">\n          <div class=\"n18\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n19\">\n            <p class=\"n20\">Ngozi Eze</p>\n            <p class=\"n21\">Operations, Halo</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n22\">\n        <p class=\"n23\">★★★★★</p>\n        <p class=\"n24\">Clean output, fast pages and honest pricing. Exactly what a small studio needs.</p>\n        <div class=\"n25\">\n          <div class=\"n26\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n27\">\n            <p class=\"n28\">Emeka Obi</p>\n            <p class=\"n29\">Studio director</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>",
