    "preview": "<main class=\"n0\">\n  <section class=\"n1\">\n    <div class=\"n2\">\n      <h2 class=\"n3\">The internet is talking</h2>\n      <p class=\"n4\">A few of our favourite posts.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"n5\">\n      <div class=\"n6\">\n        <div class=\"n7\">\n          <div class=\"n8\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n9\">\n            <div class=\"n10\">\n              <p class=\"n11\">Amara Okafor</p>\n              <div class=\"n12\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"n13\">@amara_builds</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"n14\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"n15\">Rebuilt our whole landing page over lunch. Shipping this fast feels illegal.</p>\n        <p class=\"n16\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n17\">\n        <div class=\"n18\">\n          <div class=\"n19\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n20\">\n            <div class=\"n21\">\n              <p class=\"n22\">Daniel Mensah</p>\n              <div class=\"n23\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"n24\">@danielmensah</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"n25\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"n26\">The little details in this are unreal. Spacing, states, focus rings. Someone cared.</p>\n        <p class=\"n27\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n28\">\n        <div class=\"n29\">\n          <div class=\"n30\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n31\">\n            <div class=\"n32\">\n              <p class=\"n33\">Zainab Bello</p>\n              <div class=\"n34\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"n35\">@zainabbello</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"n36\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"n37\">Handed a site to a client and they edited it themselves on day one. Never going back.</p>\n        <p class=\"n38\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n39\">\n        <div class=\"n40\">\n          <div class=\"n41\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n42\">\n            <div class=\"n43\">\n              <p class=\"n44\">Tunde Adeyemi</p>\n              <div class=\"n45\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"n46\">@tundeadeyemi</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"n47\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"n48\">Went from idea to live in a day. Our team is still in shock.</p>\n        <p class=\"n49\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n50\">\n        <div class=\"n51\">\n          <div class=\"n52\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n53\">\n            <div class=\"n54\">\n              <p class=\"n55\">Ngozi Eze</p>\n              <div class=\"n56\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"n57\">@ngozieze</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"n58\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"n59\">Finally a tool that exports clean code my developers do not complain about.</p>\n        <p class=\"n60\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"n61\">\n        <div class=\"n62\">\n          <div class=\"n63\"></div>\n          <div class=\"n64\">\n            <div class=\"n65\">\n              <p class=\"n66\">Emeka Obi</p>\n              <div class=\"n67\">\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                  <path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n                </svg>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"n68\">@emekaobi</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"n69\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d9bf0\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"n70\">Quietly the best thing we added to our stack this year.</p>\n        <p class=\"n71\">9:41 AM · Nov 12, 2026</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>",
